Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Decompile stage 3: background effect, midboss and
 the Five Magic Stones

ReC98's stub declaration files th02/main/midboss/m3.cpp and
th02/main/boss/b3.cpp now hold the code, included by th02/stage3.cpp.
---
